It is available as an Android beta, with the product site and download hosted on Vercel.', 'Many small Indian stores still run on pen, paper and memory. Stock runs out without warning, billing is slow at busy hours, and existing software is often built for larger businesses rather than a single shop counter.', 'A focused, offline-first app that covers the daily loop of a store: add products, bill customers in seconds, accept UPI payments, share an invoice and see how the day went.', array['Inventory and product management with low-stock alerts', 'Fast billing with product search', 'UPI QR payments', 'PDF invoices with GST fields', 'Business dashboard with sales reports', 'Offline-first local storage']::text[], array['Thermal printer support', 'GST e-invoicing and multi-tax', 'Windows app with cloud sync', 'Multi-store management']::text[], '', '', 'published', true, false, 1, null, '[]'::jsonb, null, null, 'https://vyavastha-v1.vercel.app/', null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, '[]'::jsonb, '2026-11-10T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-11-10T00:00:00.000Z', 'Vyavastha', 'Billing and inventory for Indian retail and kirana stores — one of my main product initiatives, currently in public beta.', 'Live'),
  ('00000004-0000-4000-8000-000000000002', 'autolog', 'AutoLog is a vehicle management and tracking app for owners who want one place for everything about their vehicles. It is built with Flutter and packaged for Android as com.jeetpatel.autolog.', 'Fuel bills, service dates and maintenance history usually live in scattered receipts and memory, which makes it hard to know what a vehicle really costs or when it is next due for service.', 'A single app that keeps a running record per vehicle — every fill-up, every service, every expense — so the history is always at hand.', array['Multiple vehicle management', 'Fuel tracking with support for different fuel types', 'Fuel expense records', 'Service and maintenance tracking', 'Vehicle history']::text[], '{}'::text[], '', '', 'published', true, false, 2, null, '[]'::jsonb, null, 'https://github.com/JeetP1711/AutoLog', null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, '[]'::jsonb, '2026-11-10T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-11-10T00:00:00.000Z', 'AutoLog', 'A personal vehicle companion built with Flutter — fuel logs, service history and expenses for every vehicle you own.', 'In Development'),
  ('00000004-0000-4000-8000-000000000003', 'eventops-ai', 'EventOps AI (also called Enterprise Agent) is an operations and event-management dashboard that pairs a conventional interface with an AI assistant.', '', '', '{}'::text[], '{}'::text[], '', 'React front end in the TanStack Start / Vite TypeScript ecosystem. The assistant talks to a Coral backend integration and a Gemini service layer.', 'published', true, false, 3, null, '[]'::jsonb, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, '[]'::jsonb, '2026-11-10T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-11-10T00:00:00.000Z', 'EventOps AI', 'An AI-assisted operations dashboard for enterprise event management, with an in-app assistant.', 'In Development'),
  ('00000004-0000-4000-8000-000000000004', 'codelens', 'CodeLens (repository: dev-insights-ai) is a developer-portfolio intelligence tool. It analyses a GitHub account and its repositories and presents the result as a developer profile.', '', '', array['Analysis by GitHub username', 'Repository-level code analysis', 'Activity overview', 'Side-by-side compare mode', 'PDF reports']::text[], '{}'::text[], '', '', 'published', true, false, 4, null, '[]'::jsonb, null, 'https://github.com/JeetP1711/dev-insights-ai', 'https://code-lens.lovable.app', null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, '[]'::jsonb, '2026-11-10T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-11-10T00:00:00.000Z', 'CodeLens', 'AI-powered developer insights: enter a GitHub username and get an analysis of the code behind the profile.', 'Live'),
