  ('00000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', 'Jeet Patel', 'Developer, product builder and founder of RAGBOOMS', 'I''m a developer and product builder based in Ahmedabad, India. I like taking an idea from a rough concept to working software that people can actually use.', 'I''m a B.Tech Information Technology student at JG University and the person behind RAGBOOMS. My work sits where software engineering meets real business problems: retail tools, mobile apps, AI-assisted systems and the dashboards that keep e-commerce operations running.
